{
  "id": "LUK.20",
  "number": "20",
  "bookId": "LUK",
  "reference": "Luka 20",
  "copyright": "PUBLIC DOMAIN",
  "verseCount": 47,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "20",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "LUK 20"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "20",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Fumo ya būdūla bo ng'wa Yesu",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 20:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lūshikū lūmò ū Yesu aho alī mu hekalu akūbalangaga a banhū na kūbasomboolela Ng'hūlū Jawiza, kwimanīla bansanga bagabīji bataale na balangi ba shilagīlo, hamò na banamhala. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.20.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.20.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 20:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Būng'wīla gīkī, “Bebe tūwīlage, īyo ūkwīyītaga yenīyī ūkwīyītaga mu būdūla kī, nīyo hangī nani ūyo wakwinhile ū būdūla wene?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.20.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.20.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 20:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nang'hwe ūbashokeja gīkī, “Nane namubūje gūyū mhayo niwīlagi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.20.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.20.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 20:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū būbatīīja bo ng'wa Yohana boolī būfumile ng'wigūlū, nūūlū kū banhū?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.20.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.20.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 20:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bandya kwilūnjalūnja baliwīla, “Ūlū tūlahaye boolī būfumile ng'wigūlū, akūtūbūja gīkī, ‘Nibūlī lūūlū mutīzunije ī mihayo yakwe?’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.20.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.20.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 20:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hama hangī ūlū tūlahaye gīkī, ‘Boolī būfumile kū banhū,’ a banhū bakūtūponda mawe; nguno pye bazunije gīkī ū Yohana walī ng'hangi.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.20.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.20.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 20:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna būkalīla kūnshokeja dūhū gīkī, “Tūtamanile ūko boolī būfumile!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.20.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.20.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 20:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nang'hwe ū Yesu ūbawīla, “Nū nene natūmuwīlaga ī yenīyī nakwīyītaga mu būdūla kī.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.20.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.20.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Lūsumo lo ngūnda na balīmi",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 20:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.20.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.20.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 20:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ha numa ya henaho ūbawīla a banhū lūsumo lūūlū; ūhaya gīkī, “Munhū akalīma ngūnda ūgūhamba mizabibu. Hūna ūgūleka mu makono ga balīmi; ū wei wīnga ho, ūdīla ikanza ilīhu atīho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.20.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.20.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 20:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū ng'wikanza lyenīlo ūtūma nsese, aje ū kū balīmi benabo bakang'winhe matwajo kūfuma ū mu ngūnda. Alīyo a balīmi benabo būntūla, būmpeeja wīnga koi makono dalali. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.20.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.20.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 20:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūtūma nsese ūngī, nū ng'wene būūkantūla būng'wītīla yabūbi no; nang'hwe būmpeeja wīnga makono dalali. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.20.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.20.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 20:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wahayūtūma na wa kadatū, ū ng'wene būūkamelagūla nguma, būmponya hanze. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.20.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.20.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 20:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nose ū ng'wenekīlī ngūnda wiwīla gīkī, ‘ī gete nīīte mhayo kī shi? Nantūme ū ng'wana wane ū ntogwa, hamo ū ng'wene bakūjūnkūja!’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.20.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.20.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 20:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo a balīmi benabo aho bamona biwīla gīkī, ‘Ūyū angū hū ng'wingīji gete, tūmūlagagi būbize wise ū wingīji!’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.20.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.20.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 20:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Būmponya hanze ya ngūnda būūkamūlagīla kwenūko! Ī gīsī lūūlū ū ng'wenekīlī ngūnda akūbīīta ginehe a banhū benabo? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.20.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.20.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 20:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Angū akwiza abakenaagūle a balīmi benabo, nū ngūnda agūtūūle mu makono ga bangī!” Aho bigwa gīko būhaya, “Ū gwenūyū gūtūdūlīkana!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.20.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.20.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 20:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūbakalalīla; hūna ūbawīla, “Ī gīsī shilī na makūlū kī ī shandīkwa īsho shihayile gīkī, ‘ī liwe īlo bakalīlema bazengi, h'īlo lyabizile lya kwīgoloolela ī numba? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.20.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.20.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 20:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Būlī ng'wene ūyo ūlīgwīla ī liwe lyenīlo akūpaanagūka paza paza; lelo ūyo lyūngwīla, ū ng'wene līkūntobagūla tobo tobo!’” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.20.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.20.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 20:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī likanza lyenīlo, a balangi ba shilagīlo na a bagabīji bataale būhaya kūndima, nguno bakamana gīkī ū lūsumo lwenūlo akalūhaya kūlwa nguno yabo; alīyo būbogoha a banhū!",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.20.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.20.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Gūtoba goodi ya ng'wa Kaisali",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 20:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.20.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.20.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 20:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna bandya kūkooba nzīla ya kūndima mu nyasala sala ū Yesu; būntūmīla badati, būja mu kwigīmbīja gītī gīkī balī batūngīlīja. Baalī batogilwe kūngwasha mu kalūngalūngīle, bapandīke nguno ya kūndima, na kūntūūla mu makono ga nsugi alamulwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.20.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.20.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 20:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bahayūshika būng'wīla, “Nangi tūmanile gīkī ūkalūngalūngaga na kūlanga mu būtūngīlīja, na gīkī ūtadīlīlaga banhū mu kūlola būshū, alīyo ī nzīla ya ng'wa Mulungu ūkīlangaga mu ng'hana. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.20.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.20.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 20:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Angū, a bise tūzunīlījiwe ū kūtoba ī goodi ya ng'wa Kaisali, nūūlū yaya?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.20.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.20.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 20:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo īkī akabitegeleja ī nyasala sala yabo, ūbawīla gīkī, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.20.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.20.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 20:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Noolekejagi denali īmò. Ī suso īyī nū wandīke ūbū, sha ng'wa nani?” Būhaya, “Sha ng'wa Kaisali.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.20.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.20.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 20:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nang'hwe ūbawīla, “Hū kūhaya ī sha ng'wa Kaisali ng'winhagi Kaisali, ni sha ng'wa Mulungu nasho ng'winhagi Mulungu.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.20.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.20.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 20:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Būlemeelwa ū kūngwasha ū mu kalūngalūngīle ū kū būtongi wa banhū, būgelela kūlīkumya dūhū ī lishosho lyakwe, būhuumūla sele!",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.20.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.20.26"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Basadukayo na mhayo gwa būjūūko",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 20:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.20.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.20.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 20:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bamò ba Basadukayo abo bahayile gīkī būtīho būjūūko, bakiza ū kūlī Yesu; būmūja ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.20.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.20.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 20:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "balīhaya, “Nangi ū Musa atwandīkīlile gīkī, ūlū ndūgū atoolile hūna ūzumalīka ūleka nke, alīyo atī na ng'wana, shiigelile ng'wanong'wawe ang'wingīle ū nkīma ng'wenūyo amyalīle baana ū ndūgūye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.20.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.20.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 20:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ali lūūlū, baalīho bagosha mpungatī ba shikūlū na shizuna; ū tangi wabo ūtoola, alīyo ūcha atalekile būbyīle. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.20.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.20.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 20:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū wa kabīlī ūng'wingīla ū nkīma ng'wenūyo, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.20.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.20.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 20:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nū wa kadatū; kūshisha pye a bose mpungatī būshila kūcha batalekile nūūlū baana! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.20.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.20.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 20:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nose ū kū ng'halīlo yaho nū nkīma ūcha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.20.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.20.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 20:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī gīsī lūūlū, ū ng'wikanza lya būjūūko, ū nkīma ng'wenūyo akūbiza nke wa ng'wa nani; īkī pye a bose mpungatī baalī bantoola?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.20.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.20.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 20:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Yesu ūbawīla gīkī, “A baana b'ikanza īlī h'abo bakatoolaga na kūtoolwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.20.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.20.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 20:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo abo babalilwe gīkī bigeleelilwe kūbiza mo ū ng'wikanza lyenīlo na kwanukūla būjūūko kūfuma mu bafu, a bene batī ba kūyūtoola nūūlū kūtoolwa yaya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.20.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.20.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 20:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nguno bakūbiza gītī bamalaika, batīko nūūlū kūcha; a boi balī baana ba ng'wa Mulungu, īkī balī baana ba būjūūko. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.20.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.20.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 20:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nīyo ū mhayo gwa kūjūūchiwa bafu gwenūyū, nū Musa akoolekejiwa a h'isaka; gīt'ūmo alīhayīla gīkī, ‘Ū Seeba alī Mulungu wa ng'wa Abulahamu, na Mulungu wa ng'wa Isaka, na Mulungu wa ng'wa Yakobo.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.20.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.20.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 20:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Mulungu atī wa bafu, alī wa bapanga; nguno pye a bose balī bapanga ū kūlī wei.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.20.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.20.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 20:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bamò ba balangi ba shilagīlo bakizunīlīja nang'hwe būhaya, “Nangi watūngīlīja a kayombele.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.20.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.20.39"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 20:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Batagemile kūmūja hangī mhayo gose gose.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.20.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.20.40"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ng'wana wa ng'wa Daūdi",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 20:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.20.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.20.40"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "41",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 20:41"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ū Yesu ūbabūja, “Nibūlī bakahayaga gīkī ū Kilisito ng'wana o ng'wa Daūdi? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.20.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.20.41"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "42",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 20:42"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "42",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Īkī ū Daūdi ng'wenekīlī ū mu shitabo sha Zabuli alīhaya,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.20.42",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.20.42"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "43",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 20:43"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "43",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.20.43",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.20.43"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "44",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 20:44"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "44",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī gīsī, ū Daūdi ūlū alīng'haya gīkī ‘Seeba,’ nose adūgije kūbiza ng'wana wakwe ginehe hangī?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.20.44",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.20.44"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kūhūgūlwa bahemba",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "44",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 20:44"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "44",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.20.44",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.20.44"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "45",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 20:45"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "45",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho bataalī būdegeleka pye a banhū, ū Yesu wandya kūbawīla a bahemba bakwe gīkī, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.20.45",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.20.45"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "46",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 20:46"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "46",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Bilang'hanagi a balangi ba shilagīlo abo batogilwe kūgīshiwa na kūja būyeela mu magūlilū bazwalile ng'hanjo. Nū mu masinagogi batogilwe kwigasīja masumbī g'ikūjo; hangī nūūlū būlaalīkwa kūja kū shigukulu, nū kwene bakakūūbīlījaga ha magele ga bakūjiwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.20.46",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.20.46"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "47",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 20:47"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "47",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Balyi ba sabo ja bakīma bachīlwa, banhū ba kalombele kalīhu ka kwiyoolecha. A benabo bakūpandīka nsango ntaale kūtinda!”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.20.47",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.20.47"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
